zle, misery my company bunkered me Till your thoughts crack like Humpty Dumpty, he is me Guess I'll lean since at the brink of going extinct So rest in peace Pourin' out this drink for Peter Seems like we pourin' out liters",
  "lyricsSegments": [
    {
